{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"483","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Counterexample "}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your friend has recently learned about coprime numbers. A pair of numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"{a, b}"},{"kind":"text","text":" is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"coprime"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if the maximum number that divides both "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" is equal to one. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your friend often comes up with different statements. He has recently supposed that if the pair "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(a, b)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is coprime and the pair "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(b, c)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is coprime, then the pair "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(a, c)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is coprime. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You want to find a counterexample for your friend's statement. Therefore, your task is to find three distinct numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(a, b, c)"},{"kind":"text","text":", for which the statement is false, and the numbers meet the condition "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l ≤ a < b < c ≤ r"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"More specifically, you need to find three numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(a, b, c)"},{"kind":"text","text":", such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l ≤ a < b < c ≤ r"},{"kind":"text","text":", pairs "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(a, b)"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(b, c)"},{"kind":"text","text":" are coprime, and pair "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(a, c)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is not coprime."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The single line contains two positive space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ l ≤ r ≤ 1018"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r - l ≤ 50"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print three positive space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":" — three distinct numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(a, b, c)"},{"kind":"text","text":" that form the counterexample. If there are several solutions, you are allowed to print any of them. The numbers must be printed in ascending order. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If the counterexample does not exist, print the single number -1."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10 11\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"900000000000000009 900000000000000029\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"900000000000000009 900000000000000010 900000000000000021\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample pair "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(2, 4)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is not coprime and pairs "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(2, 3)"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(3, 4)"},{"kind":"text","text":" are. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample you cannot form a group of three distinct integers, so the answer is -1. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third sample it is easy to see that numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"900000000000000009"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"900000000000000021"},{"kind":"text","text":" are divisible by three. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"483A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/483/problem/A"}